('127.565.d.18',3,'Vitamins A, D, E, and K dissolve in fat, so they are classified as:','["fat-soluble vitamins", "water-soluble vitamins", "macrominerals", "trace minerals"]'::jsonb,0,'Fat-soluble.','original'),
