('127.565.d.5.A',3,'Food production uses land, water, and energy, so reducing waste supports the sustainability of natural:','["resources", "menus", "trends", "coupons"]'::jsonb,0,'Sustainability.','original'),
('127.565.d.5.A',4,'Growing food close to where it is eaten can lower the energy used in:','["labeling", "transportation", "pricing", "tasting"]'::jsonb,1,'Local food.','original'),
